# Valgrind memcheck suppressions for Chained Engine
#
# Scope: unit tests only (engine_tests_unit, engine_tests_editor).
# Integration tests (physics/GL/.NET) are intentionally out of scope for Valgrind —
# they are covered by ASan/UBSan on PR runs instead.
#
# Format: https://valgrind.org/docs/manual/manual-core.html#manual-core.suppress
#
# Start empty; add entries only for confirmed thirdparty/runtime noise, e.g.:
#
#   {
#      coral-host-teardown-leak
#      Memcheck:Leak
#      match-leak-kinds: reachable,possible
#      obj:*/libcoreclr.so
#   }
#
# Do NOT suppress definite leaks in engine/ or editor/ code — those are real bugs.
